# BuildKit reads <Dockerfile>.dockerignore beside the Dockerfile in place of the
# context's .dockerignore. Everything is excluded except what ./inputs.sh lists;
# it cannot run that script, so the globs are repeated here -- keep them in step
# with the root package.json `workspaces`.
*
!package.json
!package-lock.json
!.config/mise.lock
!components/package.json
!dynamic/package.json
!stacks/*/package.json
!sdks/*/package.json
!images/pulumi-workspace/
